  "evidence_levels": {
    "EF": "Decoded BFEVFL event or entry with exact action, query, parameter, and event index. Proves static EventFlow intent, not that a playthrough reached it.",
    "STAGE": "Source-backed Stage BYML actor or transition projection with source_id, source path, and source pointer. Static stage configuration only.",
    "PARAM": "Decoded B_data BCSV/param record. Supports a static key/value join; runtime consumer execution was not performed.",
    "ASSET_SOURCE": "Raw supplied RomFS source member was present and parsed. Does not alone prove scene use.",
    "CAT": "External asset catalogue row or generated path reference. Never treated as proof that the source payload exists or that a scene loads it.",
    "MSG_REF": "EventFlow message path and label reference. The additional RomFS message resolver classified the cited story message archive as not supplied, so localized text was not proven for those refs.",
